20:["$","p","It also has a physical cost. Sustained loneliness is associated with disrupted sleep, elevated inflammation, and higher cardiovascular risk — comparable in scale to well-known lifestyle risks.",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-body","children":"It also has a physical cost. Sustained loneliness is associated with disrupted sleep, elevated inflammation, and higher cardiovascular risk — comparable in scale to well-known lifestyle risks."}]
21:["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl text-ink","children":"Symptom mechanics"}],[["$","p","Prolonged loneliness raises social threat sensitivity. Neutral faces read as cold, delayed replies read as rejection, and withdrawal starts to feel like the safer option.",{"className":"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Prolonged loneliness raises social threat sensitivity. Neutral faces read as cold, delayed replies read as rejection, and withdrawal starts to feel like the safer option."}],["$","p","Breaking that loop rarely means becoming more outgoing. It means small, repeated, low-stakes contact with the same people — the ingredient that turns acquaintance into familiarity.",{"className":"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Breaking that loop rarely means becoming more outgoing. It means small, repeated, low-stakes contact with the same people — the ingredient that turns acquaintance into familiarity."}]]]}]
